  "description": "Pure-managed PNG encoder + decoder for .NET. Writer: adaptive per-row filter selection (libpng \"minimum sum of absolute values\" heuristic), 8/16-bit RGBA/Gray, iCCP chunk for ICC profiles, eXIf chunk for embedded EXIF, sRGB chunk. Reader: chunk parsing with CRC validation, color types 0/2/4/6 at 8/16-bit, preserves iCCP/sRGB/gAMA/cHRM/eXIf metadata. Also exports PngPredictor for callers that need row unfilter outside PNG decode (TIFF Predictor=2 / PDF FlateDecode). AOT-compatible.",
